; Inherit the ordinary container and network rules from this host's udica
; base and network templates.
; Only the Nilket process type receives the io_uring permission. fio with
; io_uring plus O_DIRECT on a named XFS volume needs all four permissions;
; removing any of map, read, or write made the probe fail on Fedora CoreOS 44.
(block nilket_container
    (blockinherit container)
    (blockinherit net_container)
    (allow process io_uring_t (anon_inode (create map read write)))
)
